# App colours

Use these colours for app-like graphics you design, such as a phone screen in a guide or a picture for a release post. A Home Assistant dashboard uses [Web colours](colour-web.html) wherever it is viewed, including in the Companion app, because the app shows the same dashboard with the same civica theme.

The app palette is the web palette without the browns, plus Accent blue, green, purple, magenta, red, orange and yellow, and 2 dark mode blues.

<%= colour_copy_status %>

## App palette

The app palette has:

