<%= colour_palette('app') %>

Use accents for small highlights, such as a badge or a label. Accent teal is not the theme's accent colour: in the civica theme, that is the household's theme colour.

The 2 dark mode blues are a pair for dark app screens: Dark mode primary blue on Dark mode blue shade 80% has 6.8:1 contrast, so it works for text and controls. The civica theme does not use them: in dark mode it uses lighter tints of the theme colour, as [Light and dark modes](colour.html#light-and-dark-modes) explains.

## App header

Keep the Primary blue header on key screens, in the app and in a phone browser. It gives each screen a clear starting point and makes the household's interface easy to recognise.

